{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Finish.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Action.mkFinish\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Action</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkFinish</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">maxIterations</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> := <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Finish.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Action.maxIterationsDefault\">maxIterationsDefault</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#IO\">IO</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Action\">Action</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The `finish` action: introduces hypotheses, asserts all pending facts, and then repeats\nthe solvers, E-matching, case-splitting, and model-based theory combination until the goal is\nclosed, no step applies, or `maxIterations` is reached.\n\nThe action does not validate the script it generates when tracing. Callers that report the\nscript (e.g., `grind?` and `finish?`) replay it at the goal they consider appropriate.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Finish.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Action.mkFinish","kind":"def","line":15,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Action.mkFinish","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Finish.lean#L15-L26"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Finish.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Action.maxIterationsDefault\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Action</span>.<span class=\"name\">maxIterationsDefault</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Finish.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Action.maxIterationsDefault","kind":"def","line":13,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Action.maxIterationsDefault","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Finish.lean#L13-L13"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Action","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.EMatchAction","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Split"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.Finish"}